    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, goblin gunk? lol are you serious? i was just asking for plumbing advice not a bedtime story. \n\ncan you just tell me the actual mechanical reasons for the scratching? is it like a broken part or something?",
      "source": "evaluator"
