      "content": "okay thanks, that makes more sense. \n\nthe scratching part is what's still weirding me out though. it's so specific, like it's actually something moving. even when the water is off, i can sometimes hear a little shifting or scuttling sound from the tank. could that be something like a submerged part or a piece of hardware that's literally sliding around in there?",
